{"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["# Day 24 — EDA best practices\n","Objectives:\n","- Checklist-driven EDA.\n","- Summary stats, missingness, distributions, correlations.\n","- Clear, reproducible narrative in notebook form."]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[],"source":["import pandas as pd, seaborn as sns, matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n","df = sns.load_dataset('penguins').dropna()\n","df.describe(include='all')\n","sns.pairplot(df.select_dtypes('number'))\n","plt.show()\n","sns.heatmap(df.corr(numeric_only=True), annot=False, cmap='viridis')\n","plt.show()\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["## Exercises\n","1) Produce an EDA summary (text + visuals) for a chosen dataset.\n","2) Create a section documenting data quality issues and next steps."]}]}
